WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.964
This is Cunning Claw: an AI assistant that runs on your own computer.

2
00:00:06.014 --> 00:00:10.185
I've asked it for a website, for a little bakery in Cardiff.

3
00:00:10.235 --> 00:00:13.560
It can hand building work to Claude Code…

4
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:21.078
but nothing happens until I say so. Here's the whole brief, word for word.

5
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.559
Happy. One click.

6
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:33.609
Now Claude Code builds it, on its own branch. I can watch every step, or stop it any time.

7
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:42.366
About eight minutes. Nothing merged until I've looked.

8
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:48.772
It tells me what it did, what it tested, and what it cost: about a dollar eighty.

9
00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.631
And here it is. A real, working website.

10
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.124
Light and dark,

11
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.847
a booking form that checks every answer,

12
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.681
and it works on your phone.

13
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.449
Cunning Claw. Made in Wales, free to download.
